                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 p-6 w-full">
                        <span class="inline-block bg-amber-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded mb-2 uppercase">Sale: 30% Off</span>
                        <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Tokyo Haneda</h4>
                        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-4">Discover the perfect blend of tradition and future.</p>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="text-white font-bold">From $699</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">arrow_forward</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="group relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD99CW0oMgfxIqcDH35o-PuiTDfrOY-c2W0hELwtmRoN4636W9BOjvcZe2KYnrSXgZduZoJ4AelWDC2Bk7s3FkyfbGm8QXbdWkqrPpHKjUfoJkIaCKbWsSAlqGXgvhmAeOSCvRBQ8ntjs7jgoKkVCM-MARSXroKAf9lAstSL9jazcieYgL7LQqUemkvfyYIVXU308gRDkIQ4jXNuiVoYK94N6VSJjXL99ofZyIRS9yOnEkAOk19sJAmsip3Oe28G__URVAhQhHmhI4')"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 p-6 w-full">
                        <span class="inline-block bg-primary text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded mb-2 uppercase">New Route</span>
                        <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Dubai Marina</h4>
                        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-4">Experience luxury and skyline views like never before.</p>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="text-white font-bold">From $549</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">arrow_forward</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="group relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl cursor-pointer">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAZJAyN9szoU1QhgznM0-LsY077PdHEA8QSmE2ue2vR3a9Z4EoO7S6TQzDpSBBHw0rBmB_7x7uAe83659dd1e1DxIqfFcs57iN-5Ffg6Fzc1lbJOVVPQlD2wmGATU-5U6CLBv28pXuisoksZVBF4nD1ZxPNaAUNUxhxYppammrDIa4CQpOP3M8v8Y4TniszsdY9MDHl0SO9wWlzbBeH92Pq3OU9ZA7KnjEMx1A40mWWo-3CNJv2SRA-BBkJiBO2g5OSEhPu-vhRUro')"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 p-6 w-full">
                        <span class="inline-block bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded mb-2 uppercase">Early Bird</span>
                        <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Rio de Janeiro</h4>
                        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-4">Feel the rhythm of the world's most vibrant city.</p>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="text-white font-bold">From $720</span>
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">arrow_forward</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 space-y-6 text-center md:text-left">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Discover Our Premium Services</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">We're constantly innovating to make your journey smoother, from biometric boarding to our new award-winning inflight entertainment system.</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="size-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">wifi</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-left">
                                <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Ultra-Fast Wi-Fi</h5>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Free 5G connectivity on all long-haul flights.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="size-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">restaurant</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-left">
                                <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Gourmet Dining</h5>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Chef-curated meals reflecting your destination.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button class="bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-slate-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
                        Learn More About Our Experience
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                    <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
